"pricing-description\":\"Discover HackMD's flexible pricing plans for teams and individuals. Start for free or upgrade for more features.\",\"about-title\":\"About HackMD: Our Platform, Mission, \u0026 Team\",\"about-description\":\"HackMD is the markdown workspace for innovation empowering developers to share ideas, contribute insights, and build community through knowledge sharing\"},\"navbar\":{\"solution\":\"Solutions\",\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"enterprise\":\"Enterprise\",\"developers\":\"Developers\",\"about\":\"About\",\"learn\":\"Learn\",\"learn-link\":\"https://hackmd.io/c/tutorials\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"product\":\"Product\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"changelog\":\"Changelog\",\"education\":\"Education\",\"sign-in\":\"Sign in\",\"log-out\":\"Log out\",\"get-hackmd\":\"Get HackMD free\",\"my-workspace\":\"My workspace\"},\"footer\":{\"description\":\"Build together with the ultimate Markdown editor.\",\"soc-logo-alt\":\"AICPA SOC for Service Organizations\",\"soc-certified\":\"CERTIFIED\",\"learning\":\"Learning\",\"features\":\"Features\",\"features-link\":\"https://hackmd.io/s/features\",\"tutorial-book\":\"Tutorial book\",\"tutorial-book-link\":\"https://hackmd.io/c/tutorials\",\"resources\":\"Resources\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"changelog\":\"Changelog\",\"enterprise\":\"Enterprise\",\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"about\":\"About\",\"ambassador\":\"Ambassador\",\"press-kit\":\"Press Kit\",\"trust-center\":\"Trust Center\",\"terms-of-use\":\"Terms of use\",\"privacy-policy\":\"Privacy policy\",\"api\":\"API\"},\"home\":{\"email-address\":\"you@company.com\",\"get-hackmd\":\"Get HackMD free\",\"hero-headline\":\"Where teams and agents\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003ebuild together\",\"hero-description\":\"Real-time Markdown collaboration for \u003ctargets\u003e\u003c/targets\u003e\",\"team\":\"teams\",\"community\":\"communities\",\"project\":\"projects\",\"docs\":\"docs\",\"feature-headline\":\"Accelerate innovation, foster community, and supercharge collaboration with your go-to Markdown editor.\",\"feature-slides\":{\"docs-title\":\"Docs\",\"docs-description\":\"Take notes, create presentations, collaborate virtually – the options are limitless.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eAccess and share your Markdown documents instantly with flexible permissioning.\",\"templates-title\":\"Templates\",\"templates-description\":\"Streamline your work and keep documents clean, clear, and consistent.\",\"book-mode-title\":\"Book Mode\",\"book-mode-description\":\"Collect and categorize your documents.\",\"github-title\":\"GitHub Integration\",\"github-description\":\"Keep your documentation and project work in sync with GitHub integrated directly into the Markdown editor.\",\"uml-graph-title\":\"UML graphs\",\"uml-graph-description\":\"Visualize research or technical findings for your community.\",\"profile-title\":\"Profile\",\"profile-description\":\"Publish instantly to turn your profile into a resource for your community.\"},\"logos-headline\":\"Millions build with HackMD's Markdown editor every day\",\"logos-description\":\"Powering teams around the world, from next-generation startups to established institutions\",\"solution-headline\":\"Join a global movement\",\"solution-description\":\"A million-strong community of teams, researchers, hackers, and open-source contributors is using HackMD to build in the open. Now their agents can join in too!\",\"learn-more\":\"Learn more\",\"community-users\":\"Users\",\"community-user-counts\":\"1m\",\"community-teams\":\"Teams\",\"community-team-counts\":\"30k\",\"community-countries\":\"Countries represented\",\"community-country-counts\":\"170\",\"community-notes\":\"Notes created\",\"community-note-counts\":\"7.7m\",\"markdown-native\":{\"headline\":\"Your team has \u003chighlight\u003eideas\u003c/highlight\u003e,\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eyour agents have \u003chighlight\u003ecapabilities\u003c/highlight\u003e,\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eHackMD brings them \u003chighlight\u003etogether\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"item-1-title\":\"Teams are shipping faster than ever\",\"item-1-description\":\"AI agents handle drafts, code generation, research, and documentation. But there's a disconnect that's slowing everything down: the place where your team thinks, plans, and refines their work isn't the same place your agents can access it.\",\"item-2-title\":\"What's missing is a shared layer\",\"item-2-description\":\"Your team and your agents should always be working from the same source of truth, a place where the team sets direction, agents contribute, and everything stays aligned as ideas move from rough draft to polished output ready to ship.\",\"item-3-title\":\"That's where HackMD comes in\",\"item-3-description\":\"It's not just a collaboration tool for your team, but the shared context layer that keeps your team and your agents in sync. Your team refines ideas in one place, agents pull from that same place, and when agents contribute something back, it lands right where the team can review, edit, and build on it together.\",\"image-placeholder\":\"VISUAL: Team editing a doc with multiple cursors, agent pulling content in the corner\",\"image-caption\":\"Warm collaboration scene, humans as the star\"},\"markdown-layer\":{\"headline\":\"Markdown is the layer,\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003ehumans are still in charge\",\"subtitle\":\"HackMD is Markdown all the way down — \u003cbold\u003eauthored, stored, versioned, and served.\u003c/bold\u003e Humans stay in the loop, agents get clean content without a translation layer.\",\"card-1-title\":\"Your team writes\",\"card-1-description\":\"in a real-time editor with the formatting and structure you'd expect.\",\"card-1-image-alt\":\"Illustration of two document cards labeled Problem and Acceptance Criteria.\",\"card-1-image-placeholder\":\"[Illustration]\",\"card-2-title\":\"Your agents read\",\"card-2-description\":\"the same content, the same URLs, in the format they already understand.\",\"card-2-image-alt\":\"Illustration of a document card with a sparkle mark, representing agents reading Markdown content.\",\"card-2-image-placeholder\":\"[Illustration]\",\"card-3-title\":\"You stay in control\",\"card-3-description\":\"of what gets reviewed, merged, published, or rolled back. Agents don't ship to production. Your team does.\",\"card-3-image-alt\":\"Illustration of document cards with checklist items, representing review and publishing control.\",\"card-3-image-placeholder\":\"[Illustration]\",\"compatible-tools\":\"Works with Claude Code, Cursor, GitHub Actions, OpenAI, and any tool that speaks Markdown.\"},\"client-testimonial\":{\"quote\":\"HackMD makes it easier to share with the team in concrete, technical details the features and rationale for a specific component.\",\"author\":\"Mikerah Quintyne-Collins\",\"role\":\"Founder of HashCloak and Stoffel Labs\",\"cta\":\"Read the story\"},\"three-pillars\":{\"section-title\":\"Built for the team, open to your agents\",\"section-subtitle\":\"Your workspace, where humans collaborate and agents can keep up\",\"pillar-1\":{\"title\":\"Write together, think together, ship together\",\"description\":\"Real-time editing with multiple cursors, comments, version history, and GitHub sync. Everything your team already counts on, every day.\",\"description-detail\":\"Every edit, every comment, every revision is tracked and recoverable, so your team's thinking isn't just captured in the final draft but in the full history of how you got there. That means onboarding someone new, revisiting a past decision, or understanding why something changed is never more than a scroll through the version timeline.\",\"cta\":\"Explore features\",\"chip-1\":\"Live editing with multiple cursors\",\"chip-2\":\"Comments \u0026 mentions\",\"chip-3\":\"Version history\",\"chip-4\":\"Templates\",\"chip-5\":\"GitHub integration\"},\"pillar-2\":{\"title\":\"Built for how communities actually work\",\"description\":\"From hackathons and research groups to open-source projects, study groups, and devnets, HackMD has been the working surface for communities that build knowledge in the open.\",\"description-detail\":\"When your community has a home base where anyone can show up, share what they know, and start building with each other, that's when things start to take off. HackMD gives your community a place to gather around ideas, engage with each other's work, and grow together, whether that's ten contributors or ten thousand.\",\"cta\":\"See community stories\",\"chip-1\":\"Public notes\",\"chip-2\":\"Shared workspaces\",\"chip-3\":\"Embeds\",\"chip-4\":\"Slide mode\",\"chip-5\":\"Open-source friendly\"},\"pillar-3\":{\"title\":\"Give your agents the context they need, without the overhead\",\"description\":\"Every HackMD note is Markdown all the way down, which means your agents can pull context, reference docs, and team knowledge through the same URLs your team uses.\",\"cta\":\"Read the API docs\",\"chip-1\":\"Pull any note as Markdown via REST API or CLI\",\"chip-2\":\"Push agent-generated drafts back into your workspace\",\"chip-3\":\"Agent gets Markdown via Accept: text/markdown\",\"value-statement\":\"Markdown content uses up to 80% fewer tokens than the equivalent HTML, so your agents spend their compute on the actual work, reducing cost for your team.\",\"stat-value\":\"1M+\",\"stat-label\":\"Already powering over 1M+ API calls\",\"stat-sublabel\":\"Teams are using HackMD's API to feed their agents context, automate note creation, and keep documentation in sync.\"}},\"get-started-headline-1\":\"Bring your team. Bring your community\",\"get-started-highlight\":\"Bring your agents\",\"get-started-body\":\"Start collaborating in Markdown, invite your team, open it up to your community, and keep your agents in the loop\",\"get-started-action\":\"Get started for free\",\"get-started-docs\":\"Read the Developer Docs\"},\"blog\":{\"email-address\":\"you@company.com\",\"subscribe\":\"Subscribe\",\"su